# Cache policy for the Worker's static assets.
#
# The HTML must revalidate on every visit: a returning reader who saw an older build should get
# the current one, not a copy their browser considers fresh. Hashed assets under /_astro/ carry
# their content hash in the filename, so they can be cached indefinitely.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
